[b]CCS 1.0.0-alpha.5[/b]

[list]
[*]New on L2, L3, H2 and H3: [b]Combo step[/b], Play or Skip. A skipped step drops out of your combo: the press that would start it starts the next step that plays, so H1, H3, H1 with H2 skipped, or H1 every press with both skipped. To let a long move on H1 play out without being cut, skip H2 and H3 and set Next attack to After the whole move. Skipping the third step also skips a finisher Tarstone's attack, which takes its place.[/*]
[*]Skipped steps show faded on the slot bar, and their panel shows only the Combo step row.[/*]
[/list]

Thanks to crimsonmoon93 for the Combo step idea.

Update: close the game, extract the ZIP into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep settings.json and presets/ to retain your slots and presets. Presets saved with alpha.5 still load in older versions, where every step plays.
